('127.99.d.13.A',4,'When cement is mixed with water, a chemical reaction called hydration causes the mix to:','["Float", "Harden", "Melt", "Evaporate"]'::jsonb,1,'Hydration sets and hardens the paste.','original'),
('127.99.d.13.B',3,'Concrete is made of cement, water, sand, and:','["Wood chips", "Paint", "Coarse aggregate such as gravel", "Foam"]'::jsonb,2,'Aggregates provide bulk.','original'),
('127.99.d.13.B',4,'Adding too much water to a concrete mix tends to:','["Speed up curing", "Raise strength", "Improve color", "Lower its strength"]'::jsonb,3,'A higher water-cement ratio weakens it.','original'),
('127.99.d.13.C',3,'A footing 2 feet wide, 1 foot deep, and 30 feet long holds how many cubic feet of concrete?','["60", "32", "90", "30"]'::jsonb,0,'2 x 1 x 30 = 60.','original'),
('127.99.d.13.C',4,'How many cubic yards are in 54 cubic feet of concrete?','["3", "2", "1", "5"]'::jsonb,1,'54 / 27 = 2.','original'),
('127.99.d.13.D',3,'Steel reinforcing bars in concrete are called:','["Joist", "Stud", "Rebar", "Lath"]'::jsonb,2,'Rebar resists tension.','original'),
('127.99.d.13.D',4,'Welded wire mesh in a slab helps control:','["Drainage", "Color", "Noise", "Cracking"]'::jsonb,3,'Mesh holds cracks tight.','original'),
