('127.99.d.13.H',4,'Rebar is placed in a form and held in position with:','["Sand", "Tape", "Rope", "Chairs or spacers"]'::jsonb,3,'Chairs maintain cover.','original'),
('127.99.d.14.A',3,'The universal systems model can describe the process of:','["Building a house", "Nothing technical", "Only music", "Only writing"]'::jsonb,0,'It applies to any technological activity.','original'),
