('127.101.d.6.F',4,'Gypsum board on steel is held flush by driving screws to leave:','["Deep holes", "Proud heads", "Torn paper", "A slight dimple without tearing the paper"]'::jsonb,3,'Proper depth ensures finishing.','original'),
