('127.101.d.8.C',3,'A door with horizontal panels and a hollow core is typically:','["A fire door only", "A steel door", "A bank vault door", "A lightweight interior door"]'::jsonb,3,'Hollow-core doors are light.','original'),
('127.101.d.8.C',4,'Solid-core doors are chosen for interiors when needing:','["Better sound control", "Less weight", "Lower cost", "Thin profiles"]'::jsonb,0,'Solid cores reduce noise.','original'),
